        <li>Explain why a scene load <em>replaces</em> your stats rather than losing them</li>
        <li>Point at the one field that makes the numbers survive, and say what <code>static</code> changes about where it lives</li>
        <li>Explain why the duplicate guard is genuinely necessary in <em>this</em> project</li>
